{
    "title": "Solitaire",
    "description": "For decades, Solitaire has been an extremely popular card game in Microsoft computers, and it is played and loved by numerous people. Now, this game has a mobile version. You can play Solitaire on your mobile phone and tablet. \r\n\r\nAs a classic card game, solitaire, also known as Klondike, has countless card game lovers around the world. Do you still remember the first time when you open and play solitaire? This is not only in your memory because it can be played now on phone and tablet, anywhere and anytime. \r\n\r\nThe green background, delicate game card, even if it is just a simple puzzle solitaire, you can enjoy it the whole day. Just like the world of solitaire you play on web. Now you can play the classic card game in this FREE solitaire App. For those new players of solitaire, do not hesitate to try this patience game which can relax you, make you mind calm and help you think. \r\n\r\nSolitaire features:\r\n\r\n* Recall your memory for the game on Windows\r\n* Different levels to challenge: draw 1 or 3 cards each time\r\n* Classic game Rules\r\n* Daily challenge & random games\r\n* Finish a game with less moves to obtain higher score\r\n* Auto save incomplete game\r\n* Impressive graphics and animation\r\n* Intuitive user interface\r\n* Numerous, various themes of background & card",
    "descriptionHTML": "For decades, Solitaire has been an extremely popular card game in Microsoft computers, and it is played and loved by numerous people. Now, this game has a mobile version. You can play Solitaire on your mobile phone and tablet. <br><br>As a classic card game, solitaire, also known as Klondike, has countless card game lovers around the world. Do you still remember the first time when you open and play solitaire? This is not only in your memory because it can be played now on phone and tablet, anywhere and anytime. <br><br>The green background, delicate game card, even if it is just a simple puzzle solitaire, you can enjoy it the whole day. Just like the world of solitaire you play on web. Now you can play the classic card game in this FREE solitaire App. For those new players of solitaire, do not hesitate to try this patience game which can relax you, make you mind calm and help you think. <br><br>Solitaire features:<br><br>* Recall your memory for the game on Windows<br>* Different levels to challenge: draw 1 or 3 cards each time<br>* Classic game Rules<br>* Daily challenge &amp; random games<br>* Finish a game with less moves to obtain higher score<br>* Auto save incomplete game<br>* Impressive graphics and animation<br>* Intuitive user interface<br>* Numerous, various themes of background &amp; card",
